/**
 * TEAMS — a department browser.
 *
 * Left: the same expanding rail the merch catalogue uses (styles/catalogue-tree.css),
 * reskinned retro rather than rewritten — the connector geometry is the fiddly part and
 * it already works. Right: the selected person as a console status screen, split 40/60
 * between a portrait box and a dossier readout.
 *
 * Everything the card shows lives in data-* on the tree row that opens it, so there is
 * no payload, no second copy of the copy, and the page renders complete without JS —
 * the script only adds expanding and selection.
 */
